&lt;li&gt;Excel, SQL, Zendesk experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in e-commerce, start-up, tech, or platform environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complaints handling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
