&lt;p&gt;Takealot Group, the largest and most customer-centric online shopping destination in Africa, is looking for a highly talented &lt;strong&gt;Legal Counsel II - TFS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join our Legal team in Cape Town.We are a young, dynamic, hyper-growth company looking for smart, creative and hard-working people with integrity to join us. We offer a market-related Total Remuneration Package, which allows full flexibility according to your needs, a great work environment and a promise that you won’t be bored, as long as you are prepared for a challenge and want to build something great.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reporting to the Senior Legal Counsel:&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=http%3A%2F%2Ftakealot%2Ecom%2FMrD&amp;amp;urlhash=kC9p&amp;amp;mt=HXemz0Q7ksnoaI83oV2Tv6Z8hCxbDDteJanqxGXrDX9YPpCtkNZvLRoyefqV5Szu73LrgII_KOiXHF_VGW5-YUwkxw&amp;amp;isSdui=true&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Takealot Fulfilment Solutions &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
