&lt;li&gt;Manage client onboarding and ongoing client and contractual matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new service and business launches and operationalisation for TFS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on logistics, fulfilment, supply chain, hub/driver network and operational infrastructure matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with consulting arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support import/export and international trade matters as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage litigation and dispute resolution matters on behalf of TFS, including instructing and briefing external attorneys, monitoring case progress, and ensuring cost-effective resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on and attend to employment related legal and regulatory matters&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage TFS&#39;s intellectual property matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update and improve template documents, playbooks and standard operating procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and advise on new legal developments affecting TFS and the Group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct legal research, draft legal opinions, and provide legal advice to TFS, as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate within frameworks set by the Senior Legal Counsel to increase contract throughput and improve deal velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with TFS internal stakeholders and the Group legal team, as and when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide and/or facilitate training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design, implementation and management of legal operations, software and AI technology, to aid the delivery of legal services to TFS that is scalable to the Group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive with a consistently positive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good drafting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work hard independently and within a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise numerous competing tasks and meet deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate well orally and in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong planning and organisational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-orientated whilst remaining practical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of South African law in general&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLB, admitted attorney or advocate in South Africa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years post-admission experience at the bar, a well-established law firm, or in the in-house legal department of a large corporate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in corporate and commercial law and litigation is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in logistics,&amp;nbsp; e-commerce or retail would be beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join TFS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose-driven impact&lt;/strong&gt;: Transform lives through logistics innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced technology: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with cutting-edge systems in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career growth: &lt;/strong&gt;Thrive in an agile space that champions continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;: Your unique perspective drives extraordinary results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
