&lt;li&gt;Utilise a deep understanding of core stakeholder pain points/objectives to drive relevant initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with stakeholders related to a specific vertical / roadmap, including obtaining stakeholder buy-in for requirements and relevant project status communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obtain sign-off on the specifications from all stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
