&lt;li&gt;Solutions-oriented, with an accountable can-do attitude and high energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple competing priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Versatile and with an appetite to learn by doing.&lt;/li&gt;
