&lt;li&gt;Ability to present ideas succinctly, in writing and verbally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good technical understanding of software development processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good commercial acumen and business analysis skills&lt;/li&gt;
